    <p class="text-warning fw-bold text-uppercase mb-3">
      About TEAM SAVAGE
    </p>

    <h1 class="display-3 fw-bold text-white mb-4">
      Built Different.
      <br>
      Train Different.
    </h1>

    <p class="lead text-light mx-auto" style="max-width: 700px;">
      TEAM SAVAGE is a South African fitness brand dedicated to empowering
      athletes, gym lovers, and everyday warriors with premium performance
      apparel and accessories.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>

